WEBVTT

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:17.330
"This is a work of fiction. The characters,
organizations, and names herein are fictitious,
and bear no relation to existing entities."

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.330
"G-Boys"    "justice"

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.450
"Die, G-Boys" "Kill 'em!"

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:40.250
One person has already died
in the Ikebukuro Civil War.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.500
And dozens have been injured or arrested.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.830
Ordinary citizens have been
hurt simply for wearing

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.450
the same color clothing as the other group.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:50.410
Why take it that far?

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.160
The reason's simple!

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.500
Because they're stinkin' G-Boys!

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:01.540
The G-Boys crossed the line first.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.370
If we don't fight back, we're done for.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.620
There's always been fighting on the street.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:14.540
The fighting's been given
a name now, that's all.

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:18.660
It's within the law to have enough
strength to defend yourself.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.160
What choice is there?

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:23.370
Gandhi wouldn't survive in Ikebukuro.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:26.080
Although I suppose it would be settled faster

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:30.830
if we could get our hands on pistols
and machine guns, like American kids do.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:36.080
Maybe we could have talked
this out if King was okay.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:39.330
But right now, the G-Boys have no leader.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:42.250
We'll just have to fight until they calm down.

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:47.620
There's a photo going around
online of when King was shot.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.200
There are rumors the Red Angels were behind it.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.790
It's not true.

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:56.500
I'd like to know what happened, myself.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:02.700
Big brother! Big brother!

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.700
Big brother!

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.700
Ikebukuro will be ours!

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:42.250
Makoto...

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.620
Where are you?

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.120
Saru? It's me.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.700
You called me from a <i>pay phone</i>?
Don't you have a smartphone?

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:58.290
If I use it, my location will get tracked.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.790
Just tell me what's going on.

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:02.790
It's bad news.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:08.910
The Kyougokukai Kansai yakuza gang
has offered guns to the Red Angels.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:15.040
I hear Kyougokukai first suggested it,
and the Red Angels accepted.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:20.080
There's a rumor that the Takashi-less G-Boys
will ally with our Hidaka Group.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:22.160
As a countermeasure.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.830
Is that rumor for real?

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.450
Don't be stupid!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:33.580
But the false rumor sure helps adults
who want to sell lots of guns to kids.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:37.000
What'll you do? If you go
on the offensive, I'll help.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:41.330
No, I can't risk making a move
until I can see the big picture.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:44.080
I don't know where the traps are.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.830
Your mother regained consciousness.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.000
Guo has been with her the whole time.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.370
Cool.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.790
They're worried about you.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.660
If you have a message, I'll deliver it.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:02.040
No. Just watch out that the
two of them don't get targeted.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:06.450
Understood. Well, here's the
investigative report you requested.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.830
Your conjecture was correct.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:12.870
It was Kyougokukai that's been
targeting Ikebukuro all this time.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:18.160
Kyougokukai is a huge Kansai organization,
and they also deal in drugs and firearms.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:21.000
The guns they're bringing into Ikebukuro

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.830
are the same model
as the one that shot Andou-san.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:24.700
In other words...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.830
Kyougokukai also made Mitsuki shoot Takashi.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.200
Most likely.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:33.790
They incite violence, then sell weapons
and obligations to the Red Angels.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.410
Maybe they intend to weaken
both sides by having them fight,

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:40.910
and if possible, damage the Hidaka Group.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:44.540
The Red Angels will be used
to do the dirty work, then discarded.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:47.830
Then after that, Kyougokukai will
set out to control Ikebukuro.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.330
That's probably the gist.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:54.040
A Kyougokukai executive, Tohru Yoshimatsu.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.870
This is the man selling guns to the Red Angels.

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.700
So, he's the mastermind.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:03.950
However, there must be
another agent here locally.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:10.160
That's probably also whoever installed
the spy app on your cell and tricked you.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.120
A local agent...

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:16.620
That individual likely infiltrated
Ikebukuro months ago,

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:22.620
monitored the situation, and was figuring
out the best time to enact the plan.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:26.080
And now, they're still targeting you.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.250
"Majima Produce"

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.080
Makoto-sa--!

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.620
Found you at last. Are you
the only one keeping watch?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:49.120
So, you don't know where Mitsuki is either.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.660
Right.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:56.540
His family can't get ahold of him either,
and his mother's worried.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:01.540
But is it really true that Mitsuki shot King?

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:04.870
Everyone believes you betrayed us.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:09.290
I was set up. Mitsuki is the witness.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:13.290
If he's still alive, that is.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.370
How's Takashi's condition?

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.500
Is he under guard, like he should be?

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.750
We have that covered.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.540
It's just, he's still unconscious.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:28.870
With King not around, each G-Boys team
is fighting whatever way they want.

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:32.500
There's no one to give orders or lead them.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.790
There's talk about a final showdown
with the Red Angels

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.250
tonight at West Gate Park. All-out war.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.330
Tonight?! The other side has guns!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.120
You can't win against that!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:53.500
I don't know where they're coming from,
but the G-Boys are receiving guns, too.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.160
They even made me take one.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.330
Masaru, are you in there?

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:58.750
He has the next lookout shift.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:06:59.950
Run for it, Makoto-san!

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:03.700
"Majima Produce"

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:03.700
Masaru, where'd you go?!

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:08.830
I spotted Makoto Majima!

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.950
"Nishi Ichibangai"

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.950
He's at Nishi Ichibangai!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.290
"Chinese Food"

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.870
"Chinese Food"

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.870
--Stop!
--There he is! Get back here!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:16.950
It's Makoto Majima!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:17.870
Don't let him escape!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.450
Stop right there!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.290
"Nishi Ichibangai"

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:42.950
Hiroto...

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.620
Makoto-san, this way.

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:50.500
So, yakuza are behind it all.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:55.250
Just so you know, there's no place
for you in Ikebukuro anymore.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:08:01.000
That's fine by me. I'm busy enough
staking out some new turf.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.790
We're putting together a team in Kamata.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.950
It's been worth it. There're a bunch
of lively ones down there, too.

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.370
Then, why did you rescue me?

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:14.000
I just wanted to hear your story.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.540
I can't just ignore it
if my old haunt's up in arms.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.910
We've been looking for you, Makoto-san.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:22.580
Your shop's a wreck,
and calls aren't going through.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:25.160
So we figured, if we stood
watch at the west gate,

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:29.000
there'd eventually be trouble wherever you were.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:33.750
I've started using my head a little, too, y'know?

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.910
There's one thing I need to tell you.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.830
The one who sent Shadow
to attack you was actually...

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.950
I know. I'll settle that score someday.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:48.120
But putting an end to this uproar comes first.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.500
We'll help you, Makoto-san.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:57.250
There's no time left to look for Mitsuki.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.750
Kyougokukai is passing
weapons to the G-Boys, too.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.790
Like Lin said, they want both sides to perish.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.950
We're up against yakuza. What do we do?

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.620
Now we're sure to win!

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:13.330
Thanks, Yoshimatsu-san!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.950
Hey, it's all business to me.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:19.830
You can pay later, just be sure to go wild.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.290
You're not too thrilled?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:28.700
But in America, where you were,
they fight with guns all the time.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.450
You said so yourself, didn't you?

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:33.540
There's no other choice, Kyouichi.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.370
The other side has the Hidaka Group.

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:38.080
We have to arm ourselves, too.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:43.080
Isogai-kun is right. Don't you
want to protect your family?

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.790
I know. I'm prepared for this.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.410
"pay phone"

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.580
Isogai? It's Makoto.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.910
I knew it! I've been worried!

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:58.250
Where are you?! What are you doing?!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:00.200
I'm about to go see Takashi.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.040
King has regained consciousness?!

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:06.000
Yeah. We're gonna discuss
a way to stop the fighting.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.330
Where? Let me come, too!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.870
Sorry, but no.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:12.660
Once he and I are done talking,
I'll contact you again.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:13.750
But...!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.370
Listen, can I borrow a smartphone?

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.580
I dropped mine, and it broke.

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:22.080
It's a pain, having to use pay phones.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.910
All right. Where should I deliver it?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.000
"Episode 12"

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.750
It's a burner phone, under a false name.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.120
Go ahead and use it.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.330
Thanks.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.620
Where are you going to meet King?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.790
You want to know that badly?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:48.250
I'd like to be there, if possible.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:52.330
I want to stop this fighting, too.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.620
Really?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:57.040
Don't you plan to have someone attack us again?

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:57.950
Huh?

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.500
Zero-One taught me how this works.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:04.080
If I do this, I'll find a hidden icon.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.910
So, you were behind it after all.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.410
I figured it'd be something like this.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:30.410
But I was a step ahead of you.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.660
Why did you suspect me?

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:37.330
Only somebody close to me
could have anticipated everything I do

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:40.290
and even install a spy app.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:43.910
True, I spent a lot of time with you.

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:46.910
I had any number of chances.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:50.040
You're also the one who got
Mitsuki to shoot Takashi?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.870
And you killed Watanabe?!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:55.790
I figured you guys would let your
guard down around Mitsuki Fujimoto.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:59.950
Watanabe figured out I was a Kyougokukai member.

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:03.500
So, I dealt with him before he could inform you.

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:08.450
You're a troublesome troubleshooter,
so I was ordered to kill you, too.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.160
That's why I tried to run you over.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:14.000
My heart wasn't really in it, though.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.830
I mean, you've been quite good to me.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:23.700
Besides, I value you more than I do
Kyouichi or Takashi Andou.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:27.450
It's not too late. Want to join me?

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:30.830
You'd be fine with that?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:34.040
Betraying your buddies and all this bloodshed?!

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:38.200
I've never thought of guys like them as buddies.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:41.790
Watching those undereducated lowlife scum

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:44.290
disgusts me so much, I want to kill them all.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:47.160
All the more so if it's Ikebukuro.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.000
You mean, you and Ikebukuro...

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.700
Yeah, I lived in this town when I was a kid.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.950
But my school was a dump.

00:12:55.950 --> 00:13:00.040
People like you guys really made my life hell.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:03.450
In the end, I had to stop going to school.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:07.160
Eventually I moved to Kansai,
and got picked up by Kyougokukai.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:10.330
I can't forget my old grudges, though.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:16.160
I'm the one who gave Kyougokukai
the idea to go after Ikebukuro.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:21.080
Some of the Red Angels
used to go to the same school as me.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.450
But they haven't realized that.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:27.000
I guess they've forgotten all about
the one they used to bully.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:32.870
I get how you feel! But wasn't
there some other way to do this?!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.790
You're a good guy.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:36.410
I'll say it one more time.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:37.830
Team up with me.

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:01.160
--King!
--King!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:07.410
King, you shouldn't move yet.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.200
What happened to Makoto?

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.410
Makoto-san is...

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.910
Where is Makoto?!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.910
Today will be the finishing touch.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.250
Enjoy watching.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.950
Make me proud.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.450
Where've you been?! You're late!

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:43.870
Sorry, a bunch of stuff came up.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:45.870
--King!
--King!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.500
King's here!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.870
King!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.290
Finally back on your feet, are you?!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:06.250
You've done it now, Kyouichi Ozaki.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:09.620
Mitsuki Fujimoto was who shot me.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:12.910
And I hear you pinned the blame on Makoto.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:23.750
What are you talking about? How about
we stop with the weird false accusations?

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:29.200
Enough talk. Bring it.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:31.830
I don't care to fight an injured man.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.410
Yeah!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:38.120
Get 'em, King!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.290
It'll be just the right handicap.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.120
Yep, looks like you're not at 100%.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:49.200
But... I won't go easy on you!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.910
Let's go!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.040
--Yeah!
--Beat 'em to death!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:11.500
Watanabe figured out I was a Kyougokukai member.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:15.500
So, I dealt with him before he could inform you.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:21.330
Besides, I value you more than I do
Kyouichi or Takashi Andou.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:25.040
It's not too late. Want to join me?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.370
You'd be fine with that?

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.660
Betraying your buddies and all this bloodshed?!

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:35.830
I've never thought of guys like them as buddies.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:39.290
Watching those undereducated lowlife scum

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:41.910
disgusts me so much, I want to kill them all.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.830
All the more so, if it's Ikebukuro.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.580
You mean, you and Ikebukuro...

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:51.330
Yeah, I lived in this town when I was a kid.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:53.540
But my school was a dump.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:57.660
People like you guys really made my life hell.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.000
In the end, I had to stop going to school.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.750
Eventually, I moved to Kansai
and got picked up by Kyougokukai.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.910
I can't forget my old grudges, though.

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:13.080
I'm the one who gave Kyougokukai
the idea to go after Ikebukuro.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:23.370
Everyone! You just saw it for yourselves!

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:27.910
Makoto...

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.870
Isogai over there is a Kyougokukai tool.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:40.700
He's the one who instigated this fight
and got Mitsuki to attack Takashi!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.500
He was trying to pit you against each other

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.580
and sell Ikebukuro out to Kyougokukai!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.540
End of the road, Isogai!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:57.620
Ow!

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:03.200
That's the gun Mitsuki used to shoot Takashi.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:09.250
I asked a movie director I know to load it
with fake blood rounds used for filming.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:13.080
I switched guns with you, that time.

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:17.620
The one who filmed it is a pro video creator.
Looked good, didn't it?

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:38.080
Shall I dance on top of you?
Until your bones are in pieces!

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.750
Don't do it, Kyouichi!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:45.660
That's not what your dancing is for!

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.700
That useless little...

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.160
What's your deal?!

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.790
Get off me!

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:11.500
How about we take a little trip
down to the office, Yoshimatsu-san?

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.750
Makoto! I finally reached you!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:21.700
Big Rei.

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.290
What's going on at West Gate Park?!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.910
The riot police are getting ready to deploy!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:30.250
The kids are trying to settle
this by talking it out!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.120
The cops need to back off!

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:35.580
No can do! There are things
that are beyond my control!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:37.120
Give us time!

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:41.120
If grownups intervene now,
the flames of civil war won't die down!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:44.120
Let the kids settle this themselves!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:49.080
I'll find a way to stall,
but only 20 minutes.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:52.620
If I get demoted, you had better
show up with some bourbon!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.120
You got it.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.410
Thanks.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.330
The police will be here soon!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:00.870
If you keep on fighting,
we'll all end up in jail!

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:03.410
Still, you want us to just walk away <i>now</i>?!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.750
What if you're being manipulated by someone?

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.620
You used to hang out with these guys,

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:13.200
and now you're gonna punch and stab each other
so somebody can make some money!

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:16.450
Can you put up with that?!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.910
We're all weak.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:21.450
So sometimes, we lie!

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.870
We're all cowards!

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:26.660
So sometimes, we carry weapons!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.040
We're all idiots!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.620
So sometimes, we hurt each other!

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:36.500
But we're capable of forgiving!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:42.540
Even if we've hurt each other,
we can forgive each other!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.660
So, enough already!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.330
Go home and think this thing through!

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:51.540
Figure out if this fight really meant anything!

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.250
No, it's not enough!

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:02.660
Stop!

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:18.870
Takashi!

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:31.120
Don't be... rough with her...

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:33.660
Takashi!

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.660
Makoto...

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:41.040
I'm here, Takashi!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:55.000
If I don't make it...
you become the G-Boys leader...

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:59.450
Don't tell me... it's too much trouble...

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:02.790
I'm counting on you.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:08.370
Takashi!

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:17.370
By the time the police came,
the place was deserted.

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:21.540
"Chuo-dori Street"
"Nishi Ichibangai"

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:24.790
"Isogai, suspect"
"Arrested on suspicion of murder and serial assault"

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:24.790
The Red Angels handed Isogai over to the police.

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:26.580
"Majima Produce"

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:26.580
The Red Angels handed Isogai over to the police.

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:29.660
"Majima Produce"

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:29.660
I doubt he'll get out for a while.

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:31.660
Mitsuki was unharmed.

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:34.410
Seems they were going to set him up
as the one who killed me,

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:36.950
then dispose of him later.

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:39.790
That's why he was still alive.

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:40.370
"East Ikebukuro Central Park"

00:22:40.370 --> 00:22:42.410
"East Ikebukuro Central Park"

00:22:40.370 --> 00:22:42.410
The Red Angels disbanded.

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:50.160
My parents left me a house on the
opposite side of the Yamanote Line.

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:52.700
I've decided to live there.

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:56.700
I figure I'll only turn up
in Ikebukuro once in a while.

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:02.370
Look after all the Red Angels.

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:05.790
Takashi pulled through.

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.370
It's a surprisingly minor wound,
and he'll be out of the hospital soon.

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.870
Ikebukuro is the greatest.

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:17.450
It's a big town, in the northwest
part of downtown Tokyo.

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:20.500
At the foot of the huge office buildings
and department stores,

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:24.950
throngs of people live peacefully here today.

00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:27.500
A town that's nice to everyone.

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:30.620
Ikebukuro is all about love and peace.

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:34.200
That's right, Ikebukuro is the greatest!

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:39.660
You're Makoto Majima-kun?

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:41.910
There's something I'd like to discuss with you.
